	(text "Low pass RC filter: 20 ohm resistor + 330pF cap for high freq noise.\n\nSplit Termination: 43 ohm resistor \n+ 0.1uF cap (to short any common-mode noise to ground)\n\nOutput Impedance Matching: 15 ohm resistors to limit peak current\nand set output impedance. Total circuit impedance around ~120 ohms\nmatches isoSPI differential characteristic impedance.\n\nESD/Surge Protection: Bidirectional TVS diodes for inductive spikes.\n\nCommon Mode Choke (FL2): Suppress high-frequency common-mode EMI,\nrecommended, but R24, R25 resistors are provided in case we don't \nneed it\n\n1:1 Pulse transformer: For galvanic isolation (aka isolated SPI)\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 36.576 168.402 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "1ef43631-3dfb-47e3-8003-92dd20102e2c")
	)
	(text "RTO/RTO2 are configured to have lowest duration \nfor Low-Power Cell Monitoring (LPCM). \nWe are not using LPCM so INTR/INTR2 are no connect.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 116.332 84.582 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "4834b0c6-55a4-4a65-8d4e-b4d902cf74a4")
	)
	(text "XCVRMD/XCVRMD2 is set to 0 ohms (GND) for std bidirectional mode"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 136.906 91.186 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
		)
		(uuid "6ee2fb1b-2674-4711-bbac-69e97af248f2")
	)
	(text "MSTR to VDD for controller mode\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 74.93 27.178 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "6ef992c4-3091-492b-9f0b-68e8bd60b7b4")
	)
	(text "CS1*/CS2* to control reverse operation\nvia MCU (only one must be low)"
